Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:45.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:52.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:59.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:13.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:22.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你也需...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经有了... 新的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要... 你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.55,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:54.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:55.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他逃走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他要去哪...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是那家伙的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那当然是去了就能惹怒你们的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.90,0:04:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说 这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤疤卡疤卡疤 痛痛个痛地 卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 快去吧 把事情做一个了结！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:37.15,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的伤口...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城里没事了 吾等齐心协力守住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种伤 没什么了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给你们了 Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:04:59.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么在这个关头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.93,0:05:05.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是战斗过度了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:06.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这下糟糕了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:13.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure的力量 就在我们的心中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这力量... 是无限的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:20.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能有极限！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}速报“天窗市上空出现巨大的蛇！”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众们 紧急新闻！请看画面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,945)}天窗市上空出现巨大的蛇...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure... 快点来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:29.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:32.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是想找个人附身啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:33.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:40.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能有！这里可是个精彩的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有能让你作为容器的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,没有渴望你那种力量的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一个都没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我见识一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们所坚信的无限的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.58,0:06:01.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看...
