Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:38.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,世界拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:45.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这么说的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:46.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:48.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“力量就是一切” 但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:52.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正用着更强大的力量在战斗着！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:54.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能输给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:59.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能输给 关闭世界 一直潜伏在一个地方的你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:01.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的世界不断扩展！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:05.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,远超过你 更大 更开阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:09.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我们绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:14.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure！
