Dialogue: 3,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.37,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(900,0,1020,1080)}{\fs50}{\be5}Majesty Chronicon！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,794,1080)}{\be5}光美！天威虹晕！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(794,0,898,1080)}{\be5}光美！天威虹晕！
Dialogue: 3,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(898,0,1002,1080)}{\be5}光美！天威虹晕！
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(1002,0,1106,1080)}{\be5}光美！天威虹晕！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(1106,0,1920,1080)}{\be5}光美！天威虹晕！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(0,0,794,1080)}{\be5}{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(794,0,898,1080)}{\be5}{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
Dialogue: 3,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(898,0,1002,1080)}{\be5}{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(1002,0,1106,1080)}{\be5}{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\clip(1106,0,1920,1080)}{\be5}{\fs50}Precure！Majestic Halation！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是最强的力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是我输了...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:56.18,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还是很难以置信...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.02,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的结束了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了 是我们给画上了句号！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:19.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,回去了 回我们的家！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 还没来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主还没有回来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离刚才的通话 不才过了两个小时吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你才是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给公主准备的服饰 也太多了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不留神...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我重新做了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可爱了吧！帮我们3个人也都做一个吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 已经有预订了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主拜托我 做一个Cure Majesty的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能与蓝天大地长久保持和平了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是帮奇怪的家伙们 愿意跟随我这样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为“我认为这样做才是正义”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武人不事二君
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是找到待遇更好的单位 自然也会跳槽去那边...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才说了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子 这也算是武人吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道... 小晴什么时候回护卫队？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听她说 差不多是要从那边世界回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我等太久了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我的意思是 只有小晴才有和我对练的水准
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？要不要我来陪你对练？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副队长你可以别发声吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这狂妄的发言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}我可没说“狂妄”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你回来 英雄少女
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}{\fs50}私立天窗学园
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个遗憾的通知
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽同学要转校了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别着凉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要保重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:45.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉很舍不得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.51,0:11:48.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给你发信息的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:54.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我那里收不到手机信号 你写信吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟住在哪个农村啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:05.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘻嘻嘻... 棒球队的同学们也帮我写了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\fs50}小晴同学 谢谢你!! \N天窗学园棒球队全员\N（众人名字）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(484,589)}致小晴同学 ❤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}我会给你写好多信的！\N即使转校了 也是永远的朋友！\N永远的英雄少女!! \N这一年感谢了!! \N相处地非常开心\N记得来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1\}{\fs50}保重啊！\N不会忘记小晴的!! \N在一个班级很开心\N终有再会日！\N不管去哪里 小晴都没问题的！\N有机会再一起玩\N我们的英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:08.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:09.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不会寂寞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:17.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,说不会寂寞 那是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.87,0:12:20.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 也只是生活的世界变了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,通过通道 随时都可以见到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:32.26,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“就像小晴说的那样 只是生活的世界变了”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:35.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“通过通道 随时都可以见到的”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:48.64,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,非常干净
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:53.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 自己的房间打扫干净了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.12,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,还剩一点吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可不能留着一团糟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:02.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这边世界不也有谚语是这么说的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:05.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,“鸟飞水无浊”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:05.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}“雁过无痕”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:09.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 还是小宝宝 不懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,耍心机也是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:16.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要是让人知道了 最强的公主其实连打理房间都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:19.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地国民的梦想就要破灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:37.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,也要跟这天天见的风景 告别了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:38.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:41.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗市...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好是落在这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:47.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:57.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,"只是生活的世界变了"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:14:00.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,"通过通道 随时都可以见到的"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:04.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“不管距离多远 我们都是朋友”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:08.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“一起度过的时间 并没有消失”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:12.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“但是... 即使这样还是会觉得很舍不得”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:16.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,“分别 很伤心的”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:49.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢这么长时间的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.43,0:14:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼此彼此 感谢关照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:56.57,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我和小晴住进家里的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:59.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨都了解到哪种程度？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我时不时会通过魔镜平板观察蓝天大地的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如你从天而降 你是神秘人物的使者 等等...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我并不是因此 才接纳你们一起生活的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:19.93,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.15,0:15:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要看一眼 就知道你们是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:35.21,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,真白 不抱抱我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:45.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好暖和... 我最喜欢你了 真白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:49.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:52.09,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:55.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩 我都喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:08.37,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的便当 我回那边再吃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:10.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,可好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:13.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,又想吃的话 随时可以来玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:18.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 少年接下来有什么打算？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:22.76,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,想要配得上贤者的称号 我还缺乏知识和经验
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:28.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我准备先云游蓝天大地一圈 阔展我的见闻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:32.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 挺有趣的！我也想一起去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:34.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那我开车带你？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:35.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,说笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,祝愿少年的梦想能够全部实现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:51.08,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有一个梦想 没有对蝶华姐说过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:59.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我要成为像蝶华姐那样 潇洒的大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:07.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是好搭档吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.95,0:17:12.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 绚烂彩虹是只有我和阿翼才能使出的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是最棒最强的招数
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:17.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.26,0:17:25.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:27.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.58,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜 蝴蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:49.73,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧 要不明天再回蓝天大地？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:55.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,明天休息 我给你做云面包！好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:58.82,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的话 现在就一起吃晚饭...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:17:59.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:06.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我说怪话了吧... 我自己也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,只是生活的世界变了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.43,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,通过通道 随时都可以见到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:16.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不管距离多远...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:25.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不管距离多远 我们都是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:28.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:48.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得我们牵过多少次手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:55.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,按照我英雄手账上的记录 居然有142次！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:59.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这是瞎说的 诶嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:06.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢真白同学的笑容了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:09.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,所以让我们笑着告别吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:14.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴是真的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:17.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,真的强 真的帅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:22.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是的 真白同学明明是最清楚不过的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:26.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:26.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻嘻...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:46.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样 我们漫长的冒险结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:08.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:13.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我开始创作画书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:18.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那是关于 从天而降的不可思议的小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,与保护那个孩子的英雄少女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:24.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,以及一个随处可见的普通的女孩子的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:28.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,她们的同伴是一个翱翔天际的勇敢男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:31.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,和一位温柔潇洒的大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 真白同学！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎... 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来玩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的告别那么轰轰烈烈...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有点很难为情呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,快点吃早饭吧 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.77,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:58.36,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,（咕...）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:01.70,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:03.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:09.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:10.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:24.59,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,即使冒险结束了 我们的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:27.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,会永远 会不断地阔展开来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:32.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,就像这天空一样 无限地闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.69,0:23:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.37,0:23:09.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:19.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人去危险的地方 可不行的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！谢谢你救我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.18,0:23:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄小姐姐 你叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.71,0:23:32.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:38.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 这一年谢谢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:41.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天向大家介绍一下新朋友！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:44.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,汪汪！大家好！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.15,0:23:46.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,活力四射呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.36,0:23:48.32,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:50.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我是 Cure Wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,想和大家尽情地玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.25,0:23:55.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,以后请多关照 Wonderful！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:57.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！请多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:58.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那么！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.38,0:24:01.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,向着海阔天空的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.05,0:24:02.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.05,0:24:02.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\}HOP！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50)}STEP！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:04.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:04.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}JUMP！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
