Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:39.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD3B079&}那是能{\c&HFFFFFF&}实现梦想{\r}与心{\c&HB895E2&}愿的{\c&HC3A6C1&}蔚蓝
