Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.51,0:22:43.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD3B079&}让我们{\c&HFFFFFF&}展开{\r}翅膀 {\c&HB895E2&}飞向{\c&HC3A6C1&}蓝天
