Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:46.96,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}{\c&HD3B079&}Prec{\c&HFFFFFF&}ure {\r}笑容{\c&HB895E2&}的{\c&HC3A6C1&}圆环！
